  "description": "Dedicated-thread worker and worker pool that serialize async work onto per-session background threads. Supports STA on Windows, cancellation, session recycling, pluggable scheduling (IWorkerScheduler), and diagnostics via ActivitySource / Meter. Targets net10.0, net9.0, net8.0, and net481/net48/net472.",
